sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant V as Visibility L3
    participant TE as Trigger Evaluator (L5)
    participant CO as Cascade Orchestrator (Temporal)
    participant CA as Context Assembler (L5)
    participant R as Reasoner (policy + LLM)
    participant DT as Digital Twin (L4)
    participant OPA as Policy Engine (OPA)
    participant AE as Action Executor (L5)
    participant RM as CQRS Read Models (L2)
    participant ST as Audit Store

    V->>TE: vis.milestone (INB-9123 slip 14:00 -> 15:20)
    TE->>CO: orch.trigger.v1 LATE_INBOUND (HIGH, dedupeKey=LATE_INBOUND:INB-9123)

    CO->>CA: assemble DecisionContext #1 (subject INB-9123)
    CA->>RM: read facts (waves W-17..W-26, labor 18, belts 3, ORD-771 promise 18:00)
    RM-->>CA: facts (asOf snapshots)
    CA->>CA: attach L4 signals (ETA 15:20 @ 0.86) + constraints (hard SLA/capacity/budget)

    CO->>R: plan candidates for WAVE_REPLAN (BALANCE_COST_SERVICE)
    R->>DT: simulate P1 (pull W-21, advance W-20) vs current waves
    DT-->>R: margin: 0 SLA misses, 0 OT, mispick risk down, conf 0.91
    R-->>CO: plan = [P1: re-sequence; notify carrier; update ETA (within-promise)]

    CO->>OPA: guardrail (context-time): tier L1, allowed options, budget
    OPA-->>CO: allow AUTO (L1) x3 commands

    CO->>AE: execute P1 (idempotent commands)
    AE->>AE: execution-time OPA re-check per command
    AE->>AE: simulate-revert snapshot (reversion budget 1/3)

    AE-->>CO: acks (wms.wave.resequenced, carrier 200, eta acked)
    AE->>ST: DecisionContext + 3x DecisionMade + plan trace (model/policy/prompt versions)
    CO->>CO: mark P1 applied; keep loop guard (GPS drift > 8% -> 1 re-plan, reversion 2/3)